        "Abstract": "We introduce STAIR Captions, a large-scale Japanese image caption dataset. The dataset consists of 100K image-caption pairs collected from the web. We describe the dataset construction process and present preliminary experiments on image captioning using the dataset. The results show that the dataset can be used to train a competitive image captioning model."
